# 🛍️ Shopify Product Taxonomy Classification System

> AI-assisted product classification platform built with Django, Scikit-learn, Celery, Redis, and MariaDB — designed to classify large product catalogues into 
Shopify Product Taxonomy with confidence scoring, attribute extraction, image validation, and human review workflows.

